Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 03:04:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] event_extensions:CPER: Add Processed extension

Add the first event extension implementation based on the
CPER Processed D-Bus interface.

Implement create, restore, and serialize support for the
CPER Processed extension and register it with the builtin
event extension framework.

This change exercises the complete event extension
lifecycle end-to-end.

Change-Id: If935cb2b5c4dd3549b59ba29f86f9c6a584ba60e
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
